{"info": {"address1": "Punkunnam", "city": "Thrissur", "zip": "680002", "country": "India", "phone": "91 48 7710 7100", "website": "https://www.dhan.bank.in", "industry": "Banks - Regional", "industryKey": "banks-regional", "industryDisp": "Banks - Regional", "sector": "Financial Services", "sectorKey": "financial-services", "sectorDisp": "Financial Services", "longBusinessSummary": "Dhanlaxmi Bank Limited provides various banking and financial services in India. The company operates through Treasury Operations, Corporate/Wholesale Banking, Retail Banking, and Other Banking Business Operations segments. It offers deposit products, such as savings and current accounts, and term deposits; loans, including personal, home, new and used car, two wheeler, commercial, gold, education, business, and green loans, as well as loans against securities and properties, and lease rental discounting; and foreign exchange services comprising foreign currency cash, cheque deposits, foreign currency demand drafts, and remittances. The company also provides export and import services; credit products comprising industrial and trade advance, import export assistance, and agricultural assistance; corporate salary; credit treasury bills and linked loans; trade finance, electronic bank guarantees, and liberalized remittance schemes; 3 in 1 trading accounts; and mutual funds investment services, as well as life, health, and car insurance products. In addition, it offers non-resident Indians (NRI) banking services, such as non-residential external accounts, non-resident ordinary accounts, recurring and term deposits, foreign currency non-resident fixed deposits, and resident foreign currency, as well as money transfer services and NRI property loans; and micro and agricultural banking, and financial planning services. Further, the company provides SME banking services, including working capital facilities, trade facilities, and capacity expansion services; credit, debit, and gift cards; retail and corporate net, mobile phone, and SMS banking; online services, such as bill payment, unified payments interface, prepaid mobile/DTH/data card recharges, missed call, shopping, positive pay, online trading, and custom duty online payments; and depository services, as well as safe deposit lockers. Dhanlaxmi Bank Limited was incorporated in 1927 and is based in Thrissur, India.", "companyOfficers": [{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Ajith Kumar Kunhi Krishnan", "age": 62, "title": "CEO, MD & Director", "yearBorn": 1963, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 6063000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Ms. T. A. Kavitha", "title": "Deputy GM & CFO", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Sunny  George", "title": "Deputy GM & Head of Operations", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. P.  Ranjith", "title": "Deputy GM & Chief Information Security Officer", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Santoy  John", "title": "GM & Chief Compliance Officer", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Suresh Kumar P. V.", "title": "Assistant GM & Head of Legal", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Rajan  Sleeba", "title": "Deputy GM & Head of Human Resources", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. John  Varughese", "title": "Head \u0096 IT & Digital Banking & GM", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. R.  Abhilash", "title": "Deputy GM & Chief Risk Officer", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. B. S. Binoy", "title": "Deputy GM & Head of Business Development (Liabilities)", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0